	.TITLE	DEF_CLI	$CLIDEF's names and values (CLI flags and codes)
	.IDENT	/V1.0/
;
; A Phase 48 definition probe (testdata/mp/defs/README.md): the CLI$M_
; flags LIB$SPAWN takes, among the rest. With GLOBAL, every name the
; macro defines is a global symbol, so the object's GSD lists each name
; and its value.
;
	$CLIDEF	GLOBAL
	.END
